  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You harden your body to be like steel, making you especially resilient to damage.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Armor</strong> and <strong>Defense</strong> increase by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, you are immune to being <strong>Contaminated</strong>, you cannot be damaged by <strong>Hazards</strong>, and your <strong>Unarmed</strong> attacks are no longer considered <strong>Ineffective</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase your <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may also increase your <strong>Armor</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.CNzUcoakHX0WMxo5]{Metal Attunement}</p>",
